Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.92,0:00:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Long ago, Gold Roger,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.96,0:00:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,the King of Pirates, obtained\Neverything the world had to offer,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.54,0:00:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,and his dying roads drove\Ncountless souls to the seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.40,0:00:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You want my treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.90,0:00:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You can have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.18,0:00:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I left everything in one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.92,0:00:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.24,0:00:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And thus a new age began.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.08,0:00:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the time known\Nas the Great Pirate Era!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.24,0:00:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm done playing\Nthrough with the waiting?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.54,0:00:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, I'm feeling alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.48,0:00:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out below!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.60,0:00:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine, here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.88,0:00:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise your flag up high!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.48,0:00:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hail a brand new dawn!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.42,0:00:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Blaze across the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.92,0:00:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to journey on!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.92,0:00:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,On your mark!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.40,0:00:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Camel of other things!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.30,0:00:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, on Earth, a legendary!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.20,0:00:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.11,0:00:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can show your breath,\NThen we'll make some waves!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.92,0:01:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We run our daunted!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.46,0:01:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ain't no beginners!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.70,0:01:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause if you want it,\NThen you're a winner!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.44,0:01:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,For we are on the cruise!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.98,0:01:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And freedom is the only rule!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.80,0:01:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Fearless night and day!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.36,0:01:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause that's just our way!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.92,0:01:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Find one piece!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.28,0:01:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be the first!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.62,0:01:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard it be so bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.88,0:01:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a good verse!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.79,0:01:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all this real!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.22,0:01:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be cause my hand's on a wheel!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.00,0:01:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done playing, filled with the waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.54,0:01:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,In a world I'm feeling\Nalive, but I'll be loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.22,0:01:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine, here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.66,0:01:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We have come so far!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.52,0:01:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta make it to the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.88,0:01:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever danger we find,\Nno one ever left behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.76,0:01:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I've always got your back, my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.54,0:01:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sail on shoreward, keep marching forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.54,0:01:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreaming from the very\Nfirst day I'd make my name!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.20,0:02:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't you know that\Ndream hasn't changed!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.92,0:02:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done playing through with the wave!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.40,0:02:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,In every world I'm feeling alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.36,0:02:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out below!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.64,0:02:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.40,0:02:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.40,0:02:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.26,0:02:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.14,0:02:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.46,0:02:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What's it doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.28,0:02:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's sleeping! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.36,0:02:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,No one is headed toward\Nthe island anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.20,0:02:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The princess is leading it away from us!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.52,0:02:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't crash into us after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.62,0:02:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let it hurt you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.10,0:02:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.28,0:02:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You know you can't run away, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.22,0:03:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.42,0:03:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'm going to steer the\NNoah clear of the bubble,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.86,0:03:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,then I have to swim as\Nfar out to sea as I can!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.76,0:03:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The bubble will surely break\Nif it takes any more damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.52,0:03:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But the main entrance is too far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.38,0:03:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,No, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.29,0:03:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe Luffy and his friends were\Nthe last ones to leave the Ryugu Palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.86,0:03:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's the case, perhaps\Nthe gateway is still open?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.04,0:03:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.36,0:03:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't there some way to help\Ninstead of just standing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.38,0:03:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What does Vendur Decken have\Nto gain from this anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.96,0:03:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave our princess alone, you monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.24,0:03:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not Shirahushi's fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.02,0:03:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,She doesn't deserve to die for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.14,0:04:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Barney's climbing out of the ship too?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.12,0:04:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't be good!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.56,0:04:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What if he attacks her again?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.52,0:04:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no one to protect her!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.00,0:04:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,She can't fight him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.54,0:04:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, filthy traitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.66,0:04:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you lost your damn mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.52,0:04:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This is far from over.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.94,0:04:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I can make use of that madman.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.16,0:04:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your wits about you, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.32,0:04:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Fishmen are far stronger\Nthan humans in the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.10,0:04:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not forget that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.74,0:04:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't throw Luffy\Ntoo hard or he'll break
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.08,0:04:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,through the bubble and\Ngo flying out to sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.88,0:04:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'm going to have to\Ndo it extra carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.42,0:04:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,with exactly the right\Namount of force. Now, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.62,0:04:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Army of the air assault!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.32,0:04:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.00,0:05:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, this thing's pretty big.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.86,0:05:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I'm between the bubbles now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.18,0:05:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Horty's still under the bubble.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.92,0:05:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't stop this thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.76,0:05:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,but if we could slow it down even just\Na little, maybe she could get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.10,0:05:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let it catch her!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.46,0:05:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright princess, we'll\Ntry to slow it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.10,0:05:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You get somewhere safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.80,0:05:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.90,0:05:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too heavy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.46,0:05:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.54,0:05:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,My people!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.20,0:05:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Who came up with that plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.40,0:05:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how hard they pull,\Nthat ship will never move an edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.36,0:05:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't I just put\Nyou out of your misery?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.94,0:05:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on! Back off!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.10,0:06:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You worthless scum, you're the reason\Nhumans look down on our entire race.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.10,0:06:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,My kingdom has no place for\Nsentimental weaklings like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.68,0:06:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it, Heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.78,0:06:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We're sorry, your majesty. Just swim away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.94,0:06:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.90,0:06:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I was right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.28,0:06:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The entrance to the palace is still open!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.08,0:06:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Just hang in there, buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.28,0:06:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,She made it up to the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.96,0:06:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,She's swimming out to sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.78,0:06:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The Noah's still on her tail.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.74,0:06:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.36,0:06:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's going up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.72,0:07:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't steer this thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.80,0:07:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor, feeble humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.66,0:07:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Must be inconvenient.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.56,0:07:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You all act so high and mighty\Nwhen you're safe on land.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.08,0:07:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But here in the water, you're not even\Na match for the smallest fishman child.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.80,0:07:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,A man is only as strong as he\Nis at his weakest, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.40,0:07:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You might be powerful up on the\Nisland, but you're in my territory now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.84,0:07:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up and fight me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.12,0:07:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't listen very well, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.30,0:07:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate to break it to you, but if\Nyou're worried about Shirahoshi,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.70,0:07:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,you're going to be long dead\Nbefore that ship hits her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.24,0:07:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Shark Arrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.72,0:07:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,How arrogant to think you\Nhad a chance in the sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.66,0:08:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you understand at last!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.82,0:08:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,In the bitter end, you humans will finally\Nsee that you're unfit to rule this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.50,0:08:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,A lesson learned far too late, I'm afraid!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.56,0:08:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Truly such a miserable creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.48,0:08:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, prepare to rot in hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.48,0:08:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad that kind gesture was in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.66,0:08:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'm not about to let you get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.48,0:08:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I almost forgot to ask, Shirahoshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.20,0:08:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,How does freedom feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.34,0:08:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,After ten years,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.98,0:08:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,you're no longer protected by the cold\Nstone walls of the hardshell tower!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.50,0:08:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And now it's time for you to\Nbleed to death, my darling!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.98,0:08:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That is, unless you'd rather be crushed\Nby the massive weight of the NOAH!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.02,0:09:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But one teeny tiny little magic word can\Nspare you this dread fate, and that's YES!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.60,0:09:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Simply under that one word,\Nand your troubles will be over!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.24,0:09:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm deeply sorry, Sir Dock,\Nbut I simply can't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.68,0:09:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Why must you refuse to marry me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.76,0:09:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you're not my type!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.36,0:09:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.70,0:09:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to learn how to treat a\Nlady, or anybody for that matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.88,0:09:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Shirahoshi is our baby sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.70,0:09:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We will never let you lay\Na hand on her, not ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.94,0:09:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You came to save me, and Ho\Nis here as well. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.72,0:09:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, hello, brothers-in-law.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.84,0:09:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,We are not your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.76,0:09:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, brothers!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.74,0:09:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Some of our people attempted to\Nsave me, but then they were...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.14,0:09:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Now's not the type of tears, Shirahoshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.78,0:09:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, please don't get mad at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.72,0:09:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I said don't cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.46,0:09:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Focus, you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.68,0:10:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Father told us that we shouldn't let\Nany harm come to the Noah Solatino!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.12,0:10:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to find a way to get\Nit safely back to the sea
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.84,0:10:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,floor without letting it\Nhit anything along the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.72,0:10:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.14,0:10:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.05,0:10:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We need you to mumble your way around\Nthe underwater mountains and dredges!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.84,0:10:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't rock the boat, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.78,0:10:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's so many\Nobstacles, where should I go?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.86,0:10:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.90,0:10:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The path should be a lot clearer that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.74,0:10:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, I'll go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.56,0:10:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He won't get away from me, Vassola!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.84,0:10:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You will never escape, my love.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.06,0:10:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's as hopeless as you trying to\Nescape the hot pursuit of the Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.58,0:10:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll chase after you as long as\NI have to, my beautiful bride.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.48,0:10:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Good thing you showed up. Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.14,0:11:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But you got hurt pretty bad back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.22,0:11:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.13,0:11:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,My pain means nothing\Nwhen so many soldiers,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.68,0:11:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,citizens, and royal family\Nmembers were attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.86,0:11:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So you see, there simply isn't time\Nfor me to sit back and lick my wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.78,0:11:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, in that case, can I ask you a favor?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.28,0:11:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, but there's\Nno time for that, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.26,0:11:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,A furboat like them are supposed to be\Nthe fastest swimmers in the whole world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.30,0:11:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But with my new power, I can\Nswim circles around them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.20,0:11:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Not again!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.42,0:11:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Shark Slicer!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.16,0:11:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, we need to get on\Ntop of that ship, quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.68,0:11:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Something Jinbe told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.58,0:11:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But the ship's in a bubble,\Nso it should be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.40,0:11:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That would make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.12,0:11:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Deccan is weak to seawater, just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.98,0:12:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite being a fish man, he\Nneeds air to move around freely.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.46,0:12:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be easier for me to fight there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.86,0:12:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm about ready to\Nkick the crap out of
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.78,0:12:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Heart and that weirdo\Nwho likes to throw stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.98,0:12:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, I promised we'd be\NHachi when we left the tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.00,0:12:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm supposed to make sure she's safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.24,0:12:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems we are of one mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.64,0:12:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And just like our father, your\Nsons will become noble warriors.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.56,0:12:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,With all of our strength, we will protect\NShirahoshi in body and spirit alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.90,0:12:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I made the same promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.66,0:12:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet we allowed ourselves to be bested by a
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.54,0:12:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,scoundrel who draws his\Npower from some drug?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.74,0:12:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems I've failed to keep\Nmy word to our late mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.48,0:12:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I also regret being\Nsuspicious of you at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.36,0:12:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no big deal. Let's head to the deck!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.00,0:12:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got business there too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.42,0:12:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, come on, fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.40,0:13:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness, if it isn't Horns Jones!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.20,0:13:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, whatever happened to Neptune?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.58,0:13:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Dead, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.74,0:13:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, I'm using the Noah to\Ntorture Shirahoshi as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.18,0:13:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,A genius idea on my part.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.66,0:13:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think, brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.20,0:13:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.38,0:13:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But I think I've got an even better idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.34,0:13:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.72,0:13:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let's hear it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.20,0:13:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, it's better if I show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.48,0:13:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,If you died, what would\Nbecome of this ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.84,0:14:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Dekkan?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.86,0:14:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Heart, you've made a terrible mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.34,0:14:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I just touched you with my left hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.66,0:14:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You turned your back on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.42,0:14:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,As I recall, Deacon, you\Nstarted this yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.44,0:14:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, to be honest,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.02,0:14:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I was a bit nervous when I first saw the
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.08,0:14:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,shadow of the Noah looming\Nover Fishman Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.70,0:14:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But after I thought about it, breaking the\Nbubble didn't seem like such a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.14,0:15:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Fishman Island would be wiped out, but\Nwe'd still have the Fishman District.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.66,0:15:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you die, here and now, then your\NMarkmark power will deactivate, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.36,0:15:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Then the ship will come crashing\Ndown right onto that useless kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.16,0:15:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Then nothing will remain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.96,0:15:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What I want most, right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.40,0:15:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,is to take care of all those\Nmeddlesome straw-hat pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.76,0:15:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,For good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.72,0:15:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,True I stand to lose well thousands,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.24,0:15:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,but it'll be easy enough for me to pick\Nup all the human slaves I want later on?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.18,0:15:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thousands will die, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.22,0:15:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.92,0:15:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't we start with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.44,0:15:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.32,0:15:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.48,0:16:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Die for new Fishman Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.66,0:16:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be sure to remember you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.46,0:16:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be dead before long,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.56,0:16:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,and then the great ship\NNoah will begin its descent,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.42,0:17:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,bringing my wrath upon this wretched land.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.68,0:17:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I'm a kind man, so just for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.94,0:17:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,maybe I should make your\Nbeloved join you in death.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.82,0:17:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Your time has come, princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.44,0:17:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He stabbed him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.96,0:17:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,First they're pals, now they're\Nshigging each other off!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.62,0:17:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No time to worry about that\Nnow! Look out! Here he comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.16,0:17:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll stop you, Arnie!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.86,0:17:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, not likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.02,0:17:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not the ones I left.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.96,0:17:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear Brother Snow!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.96,0:17:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.90,0:17:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to get out of here right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.18,0:17:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What a pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.92,0:18:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kind to the world's fastest\Nswimmers, but with this power, I'm faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.84,0:18:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.88,0:18:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,GUN! GUN! FNAKESHAAAA!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.56,0:18:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.18,0:18:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.68,0:18:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.96,0:18:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And Straw Hat too?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.02,0:18:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.02,0:18:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This time, we won't lose so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.76,0:18:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.02,0:18:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, at Fishman\NIsland's Conchcord Plaza...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.60,0:19:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Vanderdecker doesn't like me\Nanymore, so he's left me here to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.96,0:19:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,There's the brakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.14,0:19:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just one more thing I have to\Nsacrifice in my pursuit of Shilohoshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.74,0:19:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit crying and fight, you big baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.36,0:19:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're the only one figuring\Nout to beat up the Kraken!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.16,0:19:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you can win, Sodom!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.30,0:19:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, take a spot!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.90,0:19:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But he's almost the\Nsame size as the Kraken,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.38,0:19:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,so I wonder why he's\Nso scared to fight him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.08,0:19:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I wouldn't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.82,0:19:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,There, there, perhaps you\Ndidn't hear correctly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.64,0:19:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't say sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.00,0:19:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He said, uh, some help would be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.02,0:19:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.70,0:19:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't really think he would destroy\Nthe island and leave you to your death,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.22,0:19:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.70,0:19:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But he did say I was gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.36,0:19:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He was just saying you should fight\Nas though you were prepared to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.60,0:19:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.04,0:20:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.56,0:20:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah! Totally!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.38,0:20:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He's lucky his captain trusts him with\Nsomething so important that's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.72,0:20:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What a big boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.12,0:20:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, what he means is you're strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.50,0:20:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.41,0:20:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.52,0:20:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.22,0:20:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, this is for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.60,0:20:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to take it so you can help us\Ndefeat those mean old Straw Hats, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.80,0:20:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That's an energy steroid! Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.76,0:20:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,How's it gonna work on somebody that big?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.12,0:20:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What the? It works!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.88,0:20:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Extra well!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.28,0:20:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.30,0:21:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have trusted you all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.06,0:21:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice work.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.02,0:21:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That stupid squid is history now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.98,0:21:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you okay there, buddy? Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.56,0:21:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,He's unconscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.92,0:21:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, boy. You do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.94,0:21:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not even the same person anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.60,0:21:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The captain will be so proud of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.96,0:21:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.94,0:21:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I think he said to kill that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.76,0:21:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The blue dude?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.06,0:21:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.60,0:21:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinbe!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.51,0:21:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinbe!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.43,0:21:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.34,0:21:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Fishman Karate!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.38,0:21:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,7,000 brick!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.22,0:21:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Roundhouse kick!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.44,0:22:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is why I say kick!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.64,0:22:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the big deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.92,0:22:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami, there's a lady here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.56,0:22:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep the butt shockwaves\Nto yourself, you creep.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.56,0:22:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it, Cal!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.58,0:22:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No! That hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.00,0:22:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He just hit me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.88,0:22:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.14,0:22:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If you put so much as a single\Nscratch on our beautiful map goddess,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.76,0:22:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,then I'll put another gap in your team!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.08,0:22:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.99,0:22:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are all his kicks working so well?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.10,0:23:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know if this guy is crazy\Nstrong, or the giant guy is crazy weak!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.50,0:23:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, great!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.52,0:23:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm all dirty!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.22,0:23:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.13,0:23:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't my fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.84,0:23:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy knocked me over!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.30,0:23:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.96,0:23:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Then fight me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.10,0:23:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I want a piece of you\Ntoo, you big dumpling!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.50,0:23:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, so leave us out of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.68,0:23:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Not again!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.22,0:23:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know but I'm scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.58,0:23:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He's stronger than usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.26,0:23:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.94,0:24:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He cut the net like paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.10,0:24:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.36,0:24:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He was writhing in pain, and\Nthen he changed color. Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.40,0:24:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it either,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.58,0:24:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,but that's exactly what happened\Nto Heart when he transformed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.76,0:24:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,At least Heart had the decency\Nnot to swing so up at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.76,0:24:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, this feels good.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.70,0:24:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,So much energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.92,0:24:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.14,0:24:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, who should I butcher next?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.48,0:24:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be shy!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.20,0:24:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.68,0:24:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not going to quit\Nslashing until somebody...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.22,0:24:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, come on, who's it going to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.86,0:24:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This is just way too many swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.86,0:25:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.86,0:25:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm calling dibs on you\Nmight as well get a warm
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.48,0:25:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,-up before we go to the\Nnew world should be fun
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.70,0:25:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That sucks it's not as strong\Nunderwater shit not as strong tough
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.62,0:25:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Luck, look, give it up already. We're\Nthousands of meters underwater, you fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.60,0:25:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You can fight, but there's no\Nway in hell you're going to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.14,0:25:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Not against a fish man.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.90,0:25:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.81,0:25:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, the whole island is doomed.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.16,0:25:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That includes your friends, the\Nprincess, and everyone else down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.96,0:25:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just a week late. Get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.16,0:25:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't protect anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.58,0:25:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.30,0:26:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll save them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.38,0:26:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I trained for two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.04,0:26:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ready.
